  "notes": "{改革|かいかく} means reform—making significant changes to improve an institution, system, or practice. Functions as a noun and with する as a verb.\n\nCOMMON TYPES OF REFORM:\n- {教育|きょういく}{改革|かいかく}: educational reform\n- {構造|こうぞう}{改革|かいかく}: structural reform\n- {医療|いりょう}{改革|かいかく}: healthcare reform\n- {規制|きせい}{改革|かいかく}: regulatory reform\n- {税制|ぜいせい}{改革|かいかく}: tax reform\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {改革|かいかく}する: to reform\n- {改革|かいかく}を{進|すす}める: to push forward with reform\n- {抜本的|ばっぽんてき}な{改革|かいかく}: fundamental reform\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {改善|かいぜん}: improvement (smaller scale)\n- {革命|かくめい}: revolution (more drastic)",
